msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "튜토리얼"

#: ../../dartpy/user_guide/tutorials.rst:5 412c11397baa409eaa7f8144022b8305
msgid "Learning resources"
msgstr "학습 자료"

#: ../../dartpy/user_guide/tutorials.rst:7 5e4a64c99161403198d20912061132d4
msgid ""
"Start with the :doc:`dartpy examples </dartpy/user_guide/examples>` to "
"load a robot model and run a simulation. Additional runnable Python "
"examples are in the `source repository "
"<https://github.com/dartsim/dart/tree/main/python/examples>`_."
msgstr ""
"로봇 모델을 불러오고 시뮬레이션을 실행하려면 :doc:`dartpy 예제 </dartpy/user_guide/examples>` "
"부터 시작하세요. 실행 가능한 추가 Python 예제는 `소스 저장소 "
"<https://github.com/dartsim/dart/tree/main/python/examples>`_ 에 있습니다."

#: ../../dartpy/user_guide/tutorials.rst:11 a56679f672a547c8af7a94ea0b6cad59
msgid ""
"The :doc:`C++ tutorials </dart/user_guide/tutorials>` explain general "
"DART concepts that apply to both C++ and Python APIs. Their code is "
"written in C++; use the dartpy examples for Python code."
msgstr ""
":doc:`C++ 튜토리얼 </dart/user_guide/tutorials>` 은 C++와 Python API에 모두 적용되는 "
"DART의 일반적인 개념을 설명합니다. 튜토리얼 코드는 C++로 작성되어 있으므로 Python 코드는 dartpy 예제를 "
"참고하세요."
